<iscomment>
    This is the overriding template for integration specific code, please ensure where appropriate to check
    the global toggle for the integration you are adding to this page to ensure that only the active integrations get included and executed

    Page Type: Checkout

    It gets called by rvw_autobahn_core:templates/default/checkout/billing/creditCardForm.isml

    Any change made here needs may also need to be reflected in the corresponding file in rvw_autobahn_core
</iscomment>

<div class="save-credit-card custom-control custom-checkbox ">
    <input type="checkbox" class="custom-control-input" id="saveCreditCard" name="${creditFields.saveCard.htmlName}" value="true" checked>
    <iscomment>browser doesn't submit disabled inputs so we additionally need a hidden one here</iscomment>
    <label class="custom-control-label" for="saveCreditCard">
        ${creditFields.saveCard.label}
    </label>
    <div class="invalid-feedback" id="securityCodeInvalidMessage"></div>
</div>
